aagto xoogaa xog ah oo aasaasi ah oo ku saabsan jawiga WordPress. Tani waxay naga caawin doontaa inaan %s ka dhigno mid ku habboon boggaaga oo ka sii wanaagsan qabashada waxa aad uga baahan tahay.','Opt in to get email notifications for security & feature updates, educational content, and occasional offers, and to share some basic WordPress environment info.'=>'Ku biir si aad u hesho ogeysiisyo iimayl oo ku saabsan cusboonaysiinta amniga iyo astaamaha, waxyaabo waxbarasho, iyo dalabyo mararka qaar, oo aad la wadaagto macluumaad guud oo ku saabsan deegaanka WordPress.','If you skip this, that\'s okay! %1$s will still work just fine.'=>'Haddii aad ka gudubto arrintan, waa caadi! %1$s weli si fiican ayuu u shaqayn doonaa.','Allow & Continue'=>'Oggolow & Sii wad','verbSkip'=>'Ka bood','Skipping, please wait'=>'Waa la gudbayaa, fadlan sug','Continue'=>'Sii wad','Please wait'=>'Fadlan sug','as activating pluginActivating'=>'Waa la hawlgelinayaa','This will allow %s to'=>'Tani waxay oggolaan doontaa %s inuu','Privacy Policy'=>'Xeerka Khaaska ah','Terms of Service'=>'Shuruudaha Adeegga','License Agreement'=>'Heshiiska Sharciga ah','Have a license key?'=>'Ma haysataa furaha shatiga?','Activate License'=>'Firida Shatiga','View Basic Profile Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee xisaabtaada','Your WordPress user\'s: first & last name, and email address'=>'Magaca koowaad iyo kan dambe ee isticmaalahaaga WordPress, iyo cinwaanka iimaylka','View Basic Website Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee mareegta','Homepage URL & title, WP & PHP versions, and site language'=>'URL-ka bogga hoose & cinwaanka, noocyada WP & PHP, iyo luqadda bogga','View Basic %s Info'=>'Arag macluumaadka guud ee %s','Current %s & SDK versions, and if active or uninstalled'=>'Noocyada hadda ee %s iyo SDK, iyo haddii uu shaqaynayo ama laga saaray','Newsletter'=>'Wargeyska','Updates, announcements, marketing, no spam'=>'Cusboonaysiin, ogeysiis, suuq-geyn, spam ma jiro','View Diagnostic Info'=>'Eeg Xogta Baaritaanka'