e one your content is written in. Visitors switch with the language switcher block.'=>'Luqadda koowaad waa mida uu ku qoran yahay waxa ku jira. Booqdayaaluhu waxay ku beddelaan xannibaadda beddelaha luqadda.','(default)'=>'(caadi ah)','Remove'=>'Ka saar','Locale code'=>'Koodka deegaanka','For example fr_FR'=>'Tusaale ahaan fr_FR','Name (optional)'=>'Magaca (ikhtiyaari)','For example Français'=>'Tusaale ahaan Français','Add language'=>'Ku dar luuqad','Front-end output'=>'Soosaarka hore','Class name prefix'=>'Horgalaha magaca fasalka','Every class name the plugin prints on your pages starts with this prefix, so the pages do not reveal which plugin built them. 1 to 8 lowercase letters or digits, starting with a letter.'=>'Magac kasta oo fasal ah oo uu plugin-ku ku daabaco baxyadaada wuxuu ka bilaabmayaa horgalahan, si aynaan baxyadu u muujin plugin-kii dhisay. 1 ilaa 8 xaraf oo yaryar ama nambaro ah, oo ka bilaabmaya xaraf.','Beta updates'=>'Cusbooneysiinaha Beta','This site receives beta versions as updates.'=>'Boggani waxay heshaa noocyada beta-da ah casriyeyn ahaan.','This site receives stable versions only.'=>'Boggan waxa uu helaa oo keliya noocyada xasilloon.','Change this on the Account page'=>'Ka beddel tan bogagga Akoonka','Beta versions are offered to licensed Pro installations that are connected to their account. Once connected, you can join from the Account page.'=>'Noocyada Beta waxaa la siiyaa rakibaadaha Pro ee shatiga leh ee ku xiran akoonkooda. Marka la xiro, waxaad kala soo biiri kartaa bogga Akoonka.','Save settings'=>'Keydso dejinta','Add a second language under Tranzly in the admin menu, and the switcher appears here.'=>'Ku dar luqad labaad hoos yimaada Tranzly oo ku taal menu-ga maamulka, beddelaha ayaana halkan ka muuqan doona.','Switcher'=>'Beddelaha','Accessible label'=>'Calaamadda la heli karo','block titleLanguage switcher'=>'Beddelaha luqadda','block descriptionLinks to this page in each of the site\'s languages. It renders nothing until two or more languages are listed.'=>'Xiriirinta boggan ee luqad kasta oo ka mid ah luqadaha mareegta. Ma soo bandhigto wax ilaa inta laba luqadood ama ka badan la liis gareeyo.','block keywordlanguage'=>'Luqadda','block keywordswitcher'=>'beddelaha','block keywordtranslation'=>'turjumid']];